Error [E0121]: `value` was consumed by `consume`, so it can't be used here
  --> tests/ui/ownership_call_consume_provenance.jet:8:11
    |
  8 |     print(value)
    |           ^^^^^
  --> tests/ui/ownership_call_consume_provenance.jet:7:14
    |
  7 |     consume(^value)
    |              ^^^^^ `value` moved to `consume` here
 Why: After a value moves somewhere else, its old name no longer gives access to it
 Fix: Stop using `value` after the move, or give `consume` a copy with `value.copy()` where it moved.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0121
